    "name": "Royal Goldenbeak and the Curse of Snowy Island",
    "steam_appid": 3390770,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390770/extras/c9338ae7af2a2272bc12c9fad34c3b5a.avif?t=1735666181\" data-has-big width=800 height=488 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Royal Goldenbeak and the Curse of Snowy Island is a 2D narrative driven, arcade adventure game. Players take on the role of a lost penguin called Royal Goldenbeak. With awesome comic styled environments, fun paced combat and traps, players must explore Snowy Island and uncover thrilling mysteries, in this side-scrolling adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout the experience, players can find lore related collectibles, upgrade Royal Goldenbeak's abilities and challenge their combat skills and reflexes against the mechanical monsters and troublesome terrain of Snowy Island.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390770/extras/c9338ae7af2a2272bc12c9fad34c3b5a.avif?t=1735666181\" data-has-big width=800 height=488 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Royal Goldenbeak and the Curse of Snowy Island is a 2D narrative driven, arcade adventure game. Players take on the role of a lost penguin called Royal Goldenbeak. With awesome comic styled environments, fun paced combat and traps, players must explore Snowy Island and uncover thrilling mysteries, in this side-scrolling adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout the experience, players can find lore related collectibles, upgrade Royal Goldenbeak's abilities and challenge their combat skills and reflexes against the mechanical monsters and troublesome terrain of Snowy Island.</p>",
    "short_description": "Swoop your way through Snowy Island. A 2D comic, arcade adventure fighter. Filled with ancient mysteries and mechanical monsters, you must rescue penguins and save Snowy Island... before it's too late.",
